{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794255830321,"sessionID":"ses_e3e0fa655ffeBB612F4VvFx8er","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"toolu_01EguuNLfCXYQh5QkZ1rbh2i","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace && rm -rf backend/__pycache__ tests/__pycache__ .pytest_cache data && cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Blog app\n\n- Set `ADMIN_PASSWORD` to enable the `admin` account (admin sign-in is disabled when unset/empty).\n- API: `/api/auth/{register,login,logout,me}`, `/api/posts[/{id}]`, `/api/admin/posts/{id}/toggle`. Auth via `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.\n- Validation errors answer 400 with `{\"error\": ..., \"errors\": {field: message}}`.\n- Backend tests: `pip install pytest && pytest tests`. Frontend type check: `npm run typecheck` in `frontend/`.\nEOF\ngit status --short"},"output":" M README.md\n M backend/app.py\n M frontend/index.html\n M frontend/package-lock.json\n M frontend/package.json\n M frontend/src/App.tsx\n M frontend/src/main.tsx\n M frontend/vite.config.ts\n?? .gitignore\n?? frontend/src/api.ts\n?? frontend/src/auth.tsx\n?? frontend/src/index.css\n?? frontend/src/pages/\n?? frontend/src/router.tsx\n?? frontend/src/ui.tsx\n?? frontend/tsconfig.json\n?? tests/\n","metadata":{"output":" M README.md\n M backend/app.py\n M frontend/index.html\n M frontend/package-lock.json\n M frontend/package.json\n M frontend/src/App.tsx\n M frontend/src/main.tsx\n M frontend/vite.config.ts\n?? .gitignore\n?? frontend/src/api.ts\n?? frontend/src/auth.tsx\n?? frontend/src/index.css\n?? frontend/src/pages/\n?? frontend/src/router.tsx\n?? frontend/src/ui.tsx\n?? frontend/tsconfig.json\n?? tests/\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace && rm -rf backend/__pycache__ tests/__pycache__ .pytest_cache data && cat >> README.md <<'EOF'\n\n## Blog app\n\n- Set `ADMIN_PASSWORD` to enable the `admin` account (admin sign-in is disabled when unset/empty).\n- API: `/api/auth/{register,login,logout,me}`, `/api/posts[/{id}]`, `/api/admin/posts/{id}/toggle`. Auth via `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.\n- Validation errors answer 400 with `{\"error\": ..., \"errors\": {field: message}}`.\n- Backend tests: `pip install pytest && pytest tests`. Frontend type check: `npm run typecheck` in `frontend/`.\nEOF\ngit status --short","time":{"start":1794255830284,"end":1794255830303}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c1fb3d02001IRCrdyAiBd4CCz","sessionID":"ses_e3e0fa655ffeBB612F4VvFx8er","messageID":"msg_1c1fb10c9001R4Bvu3sugqwEvv"}}
